# OpenFOAM raw output: time dirs + mesh + VTK total ~8 GB. NEVER commit (GitHub 100 MB/file cap).
# Tracked instead: system/*, constant/* EXCEPT polyMesh, 0/ initial+BC fields,
# postProcessing/sample + residuals, logs excerpts, tri-surface STL, setup notes, results tables.
# NOTE: 0/ is intentionally TRACKED (initial + boundary conditions, KBs). Only numbered
# RESULT dirs are excluded:
mizan02/[1-9]*/
mizan02/[1-9][0-9]*/
mizan02/[1-9][0-9][0-9]*/
mizan02/[1-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]*/
mizan02/processor*/
mizan02/VTK/
mizan02/dynamicCode/
mizan02/constant/polyMesh/
# Blender working files (keep STLs + generator scripts, not .blend bloat)
*.blend
*.blend1
# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
# Big exports go via Drive/OS link, not git
*.mp4
